### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### GET /v1/orders/{orderId}/items — Items of an order
### OrderController.getOrderItems
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

@orderBase = {{host}}/v1/orders

###
# @name get-order-items-ok
### [1] Happy path
GET {{orderBase}}/{{orderId}}/items

###
# @name get-order-items-not-found
### [2] Order not found (expect 404)
GET {{orderBase}}/{{randomUuid}}/items
